                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Don't be fooled by the claims that this is a 4X. This is one of those sort of games where you get a set number of counters on your spaces, which you then move all of to another space, and whoever has the most there wins it. It's been done before, and much better than this. There are none of the standard 4X trappings and the space theme is throwaway at best.\n\nIf you want to play a game like this, get Eufloria instead.",
